{
 "about": "ADR-0122, agora-share-item-v1. An item's content hash is SHA-256 (lowercase hex) of `agora-share-item-content-v1`, one NUL, then F(kind) F(name) and, for kind `mcp_server`, F(command) F(list(args)) F(pairs(env sorted by name)) F(url) F(pairs(headers sorted by name)); for kind `skill`, F(description) F(pairs(files sorted by path, each (path, sha256 hex of its content)))). The signed bytes are `agora-share-item-v1`, one NUL, then F(action) F(name) F(item_hash) F(project_id) F(list(kinds)) F(issued_ms), action `publish` or `remove` (a removal has an empty item_hash). F(x) is the decimal byte length of x, `:`, then x; list(x) is the count then `:<len>:<id>` per id in the order given, pairs(x) the count then `:<len>:<a>:<len>:<b>` per pair (both as in ADR-0059/0066). Numbers in decimal. Checked by crates/agora-protocol/tests/share_item_signing.rs, and by the hub, the node and the web window when ADR-0122 is built.",
